        1. Acceptance of Terms
      </h2>
      <p>By accessing or using TeeMockup ("Service") at <a href="https://freeteemockup.com">freeteemockup.com</a>, you agree to be legally bound by these Terms and Conditions ("Terms"). If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you may not use the Service.</p>
