        2. Description of Service
      </h2>
      <p>TeeMockup is a free, browser-based t-shirt mockup generation tool that allows users to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Upload custom artwork and preview it on garment templates</li>
        <li>Adjust design placement, size, rotation, and opacity</li>
        <li>Select garment colors and background styles</li>
        <li>Export high-resolution PNG mockup images</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The Service is provided free of charge with no account or registration required.</p>

      <h2>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
